{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52814","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 李瓘","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官着朝中贵，才传海上名。\n早年常好道，晚岁更遗荣。\n授籙归三洞，还车谒四明。\n东门诏送日，挥涕尽羣英。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷二。\n原署「嗣许王瓘」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李瓘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52814.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52814","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}